{"4773050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bullet Rift", "steam_appid": 4773050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4775010], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/3445c88cda9c1a3c6e8e0839165a0087.avif?t=1787417512\" width=920 height=430 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into the fight, start shooting, and build your character into something stronger every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast top-down shooter ARPG built around quick combat, loot drops, gear upgrades, crafting, and character builds. You are not just clearing enemies — you are constantly finding better gear, improving your setup, and taking that power back into harder fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through enemies up close, dodge through danger, and grab the loot that hits the floor. Every weapon changes the pace of combat, and every fight is another chance to find something better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Loot Into Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gear you find matters. Weapons, armor, upgrades, and crafting all feed into your build. A stronger weapon can change your damage immediately. A good upgrade can help you survive longer, hit harder, or push deeper than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gear, upgrade your best drops, craft stronger items, and keep pushing your character forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons That Change How You Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some weapons are fast and aggressive. Some are safer and more controlled. Some are built for getting close and deleting anything in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray enemies down with an SMG, stay moving, reload under pressure, and fight your way out before the horde surrounds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Around Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character grows beyond the gear you equip. Spend skill points to shape your build around damage, crits, speed, survivability, weapon bonuses, or whatever feels best to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/a88ff3e149a97fa76fb39f744a01568c.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/a88ff3e149a97fa76fb39f744a01568c.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/a88ff3e149a97fa76fb39f744a01568c.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack the upgrades that fit your weapon, improve the stats you care about, and turn small bonuses into real power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take Your Build Back Into The Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once your gear is upgraded and your build is stronger, jump back in and test it. Push farther, fight tougher enemies, and chase the next upgrade. Pick enemies apart from range, control the fight, and keep building toward the next power spike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/80337b5f4ca1c87ff89c14b891820990.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/80337b5f4ca1c87ff89c14b891820990.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/80337b5f4ca1c87ff89c14b891820990.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/3445c88cda9c1a3c6e8e0839165a0087.avif?t=1787417512\" width=920 height=430 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop into the fight, start shooting, and build your character into something stronger every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast top-down shooter ARPG built around quick combat, loot drops, gear upgrades, crafting, and character builds. You are not just clearing enemies — you are constantly finding better gear, improving your setup, and taking that power back into harder fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/9b8529de6bf51b018465c8e4e2916c7a.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through enemies up close, dodge through danger, and grab the loot that hits the floor. Every weapon changes the pace of combat, and every fight is another chance to find something better.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn Loot Into Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gear you find matters. Weapons, armor, upgrades, and crafting all feed into your build. A stronger weapon can change your damage immediately. A good upgrade can help you survive longer, hit harder, or push deeper than before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/2c432289ccf808e946fd9b639424e410.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gear, upgrade your best drops, craft stronger items, and keep pushing your character forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapons That Change How You Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some weapons are fast and aggressive. Some are safer and more controlled. Some are built for getting close and deleting anything in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.poster.avif?t=1787417512\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.webm?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4773050/extras/11142cfe5052187b1112c1d4752b726d.mp4?t=1787417512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray enemies down with an SMG, stay moving, reload under pressure, and fight your way out before the horde surrounds you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Around Your Playstyle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character grows beyond the gear you equip. Spend skill points to shape your build around damage, crits, speed, survivability, weapon bonuses, o